68
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:55,400
These led to the entrance of the tomb,

69
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:59,800
buried under meters of ruins and debris.

70
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:00,880
What Carter found in the 

71
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:09,720
interior inspired future generations of archaeologists.

72
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:15,440
Deep in the mountains, in the middle of 

73
00:04:15,440 --> 00:04:16,200
