85
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:58,600
This intact tomb made Tutankhamun

86
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:02,240
in the most famous of the pharaohs.

87
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:06,200
Now Aliaa is investigating the life of this golden pharaoh

88
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:06,980
-Guaoooo.

